// Roll: a forward roll, 32 ticks, as long as the default roll_ticks
// (docs/architecture.md section 11, "模型和动画"); a longer or shorter
// roll plays it slower or faster. The node does not move; the game
// moves it forward.
// Rotations are YXZ degrees about each bone's position along the model's
// axes (+X right, +Y up, -Z forward); see assets/anims/README.md for which
// way each bone turns.
//
// Tick 0: standing. 2: going down. 4: diving, crouched, the left foot ahead. 8 to 24:
// tucked up with the blade held out level to the right, the whole body
// turning a full circle forward about its middle (root turns -X and
// moves so that it turns about the middle, which rides at the height
// that keeps the lowest part of the body on the ground). 24: round again, crouching on both feet. 28: rising. 32:
// standing, a little low, ready for idle or run.
(
    length: 32,
    looping: false,
    bones: {
        // The tumble: -X turns the whole body forward; the move keeps the
        // turn about the tuck's middle, not about the feet. -360 is the
        // start again, one whole turn later.
        "root": (
